seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:210:- For each row spanned by such a hole, emit a red ray across the entire right half of the grid.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:252:Assemble scattered jigsaw pieces into a rectangle, recoloring each by a legend sprite's color map.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:256:- Several monochrome non-bg sprites (the \"pieces\"), scattered across the grid.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:257:- One sprite is the legend: it contains a multi-color k×k patch (typically 2×2) encoding output colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:261:- The legend's k×k color patch defines a spatial color map over the rectangle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:262:- Each piece is recolored to the legend-map color corresponding to its position in the assembled rectangle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:264:Key insight: The legend piece doubles as both a jigsaw piece and a color key — its internal k×k palette assigns colors by spatial quadrant.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:353:- Recolor every track segment along that path to grey.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:362:Slide yellow pixels inside walled regions in the direction dictated by border-legend arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:366:- Border legends: small rectangles on the grid edge whose fill color C matches a region's border color. Each legend contains a center dot and an indicator dot encoding a direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:369:- For each enclosed region, identify its border color C and look up the legend with fill color C.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/prompt.md:370:- The direction from the legend's center dot to its indicator dot gives the slide direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1585589040/1/des.md:25:  - 网格中央偏右有一个由 grey 像素绘制的大型模板形状，模板内部包含若干不同形状的空槽（bg 色区域），每个空槽的形